Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.84,0:00:16.95,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,What's with these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:20.05,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Are they telling us not to go any farther?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:22.62,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,It seems like they're all guarding the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:28.59,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs29.5}They might think we’re grave robbers or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.59,0:00:34.36,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}Look, we're not like that.\NPlease just let us through.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:41.20,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Like I said, we're not grave robbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:45.41,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Hey...!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:49.21,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Wait, brother. Something feels off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.44,0:00:49.21,Serifa Std,,0,0,410,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:53.72,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.82,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Brother, these people...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:01:00.46,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this feels like the same pattern as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.77,0:01:11.77,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Golems?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.77,0:01:13.84,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Damn it! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.14,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Let's pull back for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:22.98,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Why are there golems inside the city?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:25.78,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me, I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:34.66,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}Hey, this is serious! There are monsters called golems over there!\NYou all need to evacuate right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:37.29,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}{\c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,1030,\c&HE7F8FF&}\NHey, this is serious! There are monsters called golems over there!\NYou all need to evacuate right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.74,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,So, the Siam-Sid was a city of golems?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.74,0:01:53.94,Serifa Std,,0,0,1,,{\fs22.5}This is a ruined city! I knew something was strange!\NSo that's what it was after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.94,0:01:58.68,Serifa Std,,0,0,0,,{\fs25.3}If you knew that, you could've said so from the start, old man!
